  "question": {
    "text": "If the term without <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>22</mn></msup></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7315</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced></math> is equal to _____ ."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>General term in the binomial expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>22</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>22</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mfenced><mrow><mn>22</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>22</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>44</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>r</mi></msup></math></p><p>For term independent of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>44</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>22</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>7315</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>22</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>7315</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7315</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>7315</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
  }
